ll but ceased, starvation and disease has wiped out most of what was left after the initial fighting. <strong>Lord Abaddon<\/strong> still hopes to lead his people to a new paradise and his people fight on, slaughtering those in the way. Despite the mistakes of the past you must fight the evil that threatens to turn the world to ash.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3977090\/extras\/00bf81a0c31a969fa283997097631fa0.poster.avif?t=1774375197\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3977090\/extras\/00bf81a0c31a969fa283997097631fa0.mp4?t=1774375197\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p>","short_description":"Fight difficult enemies, explore dangerous locations, and gain strength in this hand crafted world to defeat the evil that lays waste to these Scarred Lands.","supported_languages":"영어<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>음성이 지원되는 언어","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3977090\/0b03915e7f9683f18ba291dbff60174c2410733d\/header.jpg?t=1774375197","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3977090\/38a4e37bbdbb9f7313123c3e33983b33c64da17d\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774375197","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3977090\/38a4e37bbdbb9f7313123c3e33983b33c64da17d\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774375197","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>최소:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>메모리:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>저장 공간:<\/strong> 2 GB 사용 가능 공간<br><\/li><li><strong>추가 사항:<\/strong> Minimum is mostly unknown<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>권장:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>메모리:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><